  "notes": "The open-source Qt online repository of download.qt.io (desktop, gcc_64): its Updates.xml names the archives, ARCHIVE.sha256 beside each pins it (written by scripts/qt_recipe.py qt VERSION). x86_64 only: the aarch64 builds need glibc 2.38. QT_PLUGIN_PATH and QML_IMPORT_PATH are not set: Qt finds its own plugins and QML modules from where its libraries are, and the variables would send every other Qt of the sandbox (PySide6's, a project's own) to this one's."
